import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 395 | Dou Continent | Series Summary: The Ultimate Catastrophe of Predatory Cultivation","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 395 | Dou Continent | Series Summary: The Ultimate Catastrophe of Predatory Cultivation","no":395,"module":2,"tags":["Dou Continent","Series Summary","Predatory Cultivation","Ultimate Catastrophe","Overview"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto","30-Five Symbiotic-Civilization Typology Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0395_模块2-斗罗-系列总结-掠夺式修炼的终极灾难.md","filePath":"en/0395_模块2-斗罗-系列总结-掠夺式修炼的终极灾难.md"}'),a={name:"en/0395_模块2-斗罗-系列总结-掠夺式修炼的终极灾难.md"};function s(r,e,l,d,u,h){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-395-dou-continent-series-summary-the-ultimate-catastrophe-of-predatory-cultivation" tabindex="-1">Entry 395 | Dou Continent | Series Summary: The Ultimate Catastrophe of Predatory Cultivation <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-395-dou-continent-series-summary-the-ultimate-catastrophe-of-predatory-cultivation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 395 | Dou Continent | Series Summary: The Ultimate Catastrophe of Predatory Cultivation&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Dou Continent System Decomposition (Entry 36 · Summary) | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 01, 30</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-one-person-becomes-a-god-one-world-runs-dry" tabindex="-1">Introduction: One person becomes a god, one world runs dry <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-one-person-becomes-a-god-one-world-runs-dry" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: One person becomes a god, one world runs dry&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Thirty-six entries of decomposition later, Dou Continent&#39;s full picture is finally clear: with the most gorgeous leveling thrill, it demonstrates predatory cultivation&#39;s ultimate catastrophe to the fullest — Tang San ascends the God-King&#39;s throne, soul beasts head for extinction, the Divine Realm closes and stagnates, martial-soulless people fall silent, twenty realms collapse, the setting retcons to ending. This entry, taking the law-first axiom as core, closes the entire Dou decomposition series. Protagonist uniqueness dependency: <strong>high (gift-style leaning oligarchic)</strong>. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judging base has been upgraded to the six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones-series-grand-ledger" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones (Series Grand Ledger) <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones-series-grand-ledger" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones (Series Grand Ledger)&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>God-King-tier energy utilization only 15-20%; 80% of power used to deify the whole family</li><li>Hunting soul rings causes ~90% Origin loss; plane energy net-consumed</li><li>Divine Realm closed; the mortal world loses divine-tier feedback; thousands of years of standing still</li></ul><p>In one sentence: the glory of one person becoming a god is bought with the whole world&#39;s depletion.</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-series-grand-ledger" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Series Grand Ledger) <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-series-grand-ledger" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Series Grand Ledger)&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li>Soul-beast stock depleted; evolution built on non-renewable consumption</li><li>Divine Realm closed and self-defending; the mortal world loses feedback</li><li>Divine positions family-hereditary; person present, policy rises; person dies, policy dies</li><li>Martial-soulless people structurally idled; civilization&#39;s basic creativity weak</li></ol><p>Regression is no accident, but the mathematical inevitability of the two roads &quot;consume stock + family monopoly.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking-series-grand-ledger" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking (Series Grand Ledger) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking-series-grand-ledger" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking (Series Grand Ledger)&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Tang San is old rules&#39; greatest beneficiary, and also their firmest maintainer</li><li>He internalizes the institutional predation of &quot;kill soul beast for ring&quot; into genius instinct</li><li>He overthrew Spirit Hall&#39;s monopoly, but pocketed monopoly into his own family</li><li>He drops in as a transmigrator, disturbing this world&#39;s causality without filing</li></ul><p>Predatory thinking in him is not evil, but system — this is what most deserves vigilance.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative-series-grand-ledger" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative (Series Grand Ledger) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative-series-grand-ledger" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative (Series Grand Ledger)&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dou Predatory Cultivation</th><th>Anchor-Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Hunt soul beast for ring</td><td>Path D · human-engineered Dao-Law soul rings; zero killing</td></tr><tr><td>Soul beast = resource</td><td>Myriad-Ranks republic; soul beasts equal</td></tr><tr><td>Divine positions family-private</td><td>God-tier qualification open-examined</td></tr><tr><td>Twenty-layer inflation</td><td>Nine-plus-two stable framework</td></tr><tr><td>Protagonist-halo exception</td><td>Law precedes; contradiction self-check</td></tr><tr><td>One person decides all</td><td>Lin-Hao-style victim reconstruction; network-style civilization</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The alternative&#39;s essence: turn &quot;kill one beast, level one tier&quot; into &quot;cultivate one Dao-Law, nourish Myriad Ranks.&quot;</p><p>The whole series&#39; ultimate alternative can condense to one sentence: use Path D · human-engineered Dao-Law soul rings to abolish killing, use Lin-Hao-style reconstruction to replace the family divine dynasty, use Myriad-Ranks republic to replace human-centeredness, use law-precedence to replace plot kidnapping. One person becoming a god is not ascension; letting Myriad Ranks move forward together via man-made Dao laws and the Alaya Network is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s recognized true way out.</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan-series-conclusion" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan (Series Conclusion) <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan-series-conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan (Series Conclusion)&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li>Tang San absent = civilization collapse, confirming high protagonist-uniqueness dependency</li><li>After Anchor Symbiosis injected, plane energy terminal rises dozens of times</li><li>Path D + Alaya supervision + Myriad-Ranks republic, root-cures soul-beast extinction</li></ol><p>The Quest Sediment Domain conclusion: Dou is not unsavable, but must change the operating system, not the protagonist.</p><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment-series-summary" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment (Series Summary) <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment-series-summary" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment (Series Summary)&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Comprehensive self-consistency: ~25/100 (low)</strong></li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: extreme (this series&#39; #1 negative textbook)</strong></li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: high (gift-style leaning oligarchic)</strong></li><li><strong>Series positioning</strong>: Dou Continent is the dual typical case of &quot;predatory cultivation + plot kidnapping setting,&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s five axioms&#39; best negative footnote</li></ul><p>Thirty-six entries&#39; final landing point can condense to Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s one verdict: predatory cultivation can send one person to God-King, but takes the whole world toward depletion. Tang San is not a villain; he only walked a road that walks thinner and thinner. What Heng Yuan Zhou gives is another road that walks thicker and thicker.</p><p>Finally emphasize: Heng Yuan Zhou does not require the Dou world to become a mediocre world of &quot;no conflict, no genius, everyone equal.&quot; Path D and Lin Hao still allow geniuses to lead, still allow competition and growth; what it changes is only competition&#39;s direction — from &quot;mutual hunting&quot; to &quot;joint increment development.&quot; Geniuses still shine, but their shine is built on making Myriad Ranks thicker, not making the world thinner. This is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s complete answer to Dou.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the glory of one person becoming a god, at the cost of the world&#39;s depletion</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: hunting soul rings is institutional predation, internalized into genius instinct</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang San is harder than Tang Luo — Tang Luo at least universally benefited humankind; Tang San even swaps &quot;universal benefit&quot; for family divine positions</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: soul beasts, martial-soulless people, women, foreign races are all sacrificed in Dou</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the system of &quot;consume stock + closed Divine Realm&quot; is farthest from the symbiotic cosmos</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dou Continent with thirty-six entries proves one thing: predatory cultivation can send one person to God-King, but takes the whole world toward depletion. Tang San is not a villain, but his road is a dead end. What Heng Yuan Zhou gives is not a judgment on Tang San, but a living road — Path D · human-engineered Dao-Law soul rings, Lin-Hao-style victim reconstruction, Myriad-Ranks republic, law-precedence. One person becoming a god is not greatness; letting Myriad Ranks move forward together is true ascension.</p><p>In the final analysis, Dou Continent · series summary · ultimate catastrophe of predatory cultivation described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./360_模块2-斗罗-总论唐三与魂环掠夺体系定性.html">Entry 360 · Dou Overview</a> · <a href="./376_模块2-斗罗-唐三vs衡元宙-魂环掠夺与人造道则的分野.html">Entry 376 · Tang San vs. Heng Yuan Zhou</a> · <a href="./383_模块2-斗罗-制度替代收益-锚点共生注入斗罗世界.html">Entry 383 · Institutional Alternative Benefit</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const m=i(a,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
